:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Work
<<effects>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-presence>>
<<if !_shrinePerson or _shrine.scene isnot 'work'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'There is nobody working on the veranda now.' '廊下现在没有人在忙了。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>>
<<switch _shrine.step>>
  <<case ''>>
    <<set _shrineWorkSteps to _shrine.memory is 'bell' and Math.floor(Time.days) % 3 isnot 0>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Tsukihan has brought out a coil of cord, a brush and a shallow tray.
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>
          <<He>> lines the tools up along the board before turning to you. "Thank you for waiting. There are two things I need to finish."
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>
          <<He>> moves the tray out of your way. "Good timing. Would you stay while I finish these?"
        <<else>>
          "Good. <<if _shrineWorkSteps>>The steps and the offering table.<<else>>The bell first, then the table.<</if>>" <<He>> puts the brush down and checks that there is room for you beside the board.
        <</if>>
        <<if _shrineWorkSteps>>
          <<He>> tests the knot you tied, then leaves it hanging. "Still holding. We can do the steps today." <<He>> props the stiff brush by the gate.
        <<elseif _shrine.memory is 'bell'>>
          <<He>> takes down the bell rope you worked on together and checks the knot. "Still holding. Let's tighten this end while it's down."
        <<else>>
          <<He>> eases the bell rope off its hook and lays it across a board, picking loose threads from the knot. "It catches when I pull it. I want to check it before anyone uses it."
        <</if>><br><br>
        There are little wooden plaques drying on the tray. Tsukihan wipes a thin line of water from one edge. "These need turning over, too. I try to do the table before the floor, or I only end up sweeping twice." <<He>> makes room for you beside the board.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        月羽拿来一卷绳子、一把刷子和一只浅盘。
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>
          <<He>>先沿着木板摆齐工具，才转过来。“让你久等了。我还有两件事要收尾。”
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>
          <<He>>把浅盘往旁边挪开。“来得正好。等我把这点事做完，再走好不好？”
        <<else>>
          “正好。<<if _shrineWorkSteps>>台阶和供桌都该清一清了。<<else>>先弄铃绳，再收供桌。<</if>>”<<He>>放下刷子，看看木板旁边，给你留出位置。
        <</if>>
        <<if _shrineWorkSteps>>
          <<He>>试了试你系过的绳结，没有再解开。“还牢着。今天弄弄台阶吧。”<<He>>把硬刷靠到门边。
        <<elseif _shrine.memory is 'bell'>>
          <<He>>取下你们先前整理过的铃绳，检查了一下绳结。“还牢着。既然拿下来了，把这头再收紧些吧。”
        <<else>>
          <<He>>把铃绳从挂钩上取下，放到木板上，挑开绳结里夹着的旧线。“拉着有点卡。我想赶在有人用之前看看。”
        <</if>><br><br>
        浅盘里还摊着几块小木牌。月羽擦掉边沿一道细细的水痕。“这些也得翻过来晾晾。我一般先收拾供桌，再扫地，省得扫完又弄脏一遍。”<<He>>往旁边挪了一点，给你腾出地方。
    <</language>><br><br>
    <<if !pcAreArmsBound('any')>>
      <<if _shrineWorkSteps>>
        <<icon 'broom-dustpan.png'>><<lanLink ['Clear the stone steps together', '一起清理石阶'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Work'>>
          <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'steps' 'work'>>
        <</lanLink>><<ghousekeeping>><<lstress>><<glove>><br>
      <<else>>
        <<icon 'raven-shrine/bell-rope.png'>><<lanLink ['Help check and secure the bell rope', '帮忙检查、系稳铃绳'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Work'>>
          <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'tie' 'work' 'bell'>>
        <</lanLink>><<ghousekeeping>><<lstress>><<glove>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<icon 'raven-shrine/wooden-plaques.png'>><<lanLink ['Sort the offering table and dry the plaques', '整理供桌，把木牌晾好'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Work'>>
        <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'offerings' 'work'>>
      <</lanLink>><<ghousekeeping>><<lstress>><<glove>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<icon 'raven-shrine/bench.png'>><<lanLink ['Sit nearby and keep Tsukihan company', '坐在旁边陪着月羽'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Work'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'company' 'work'>>
    <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<glove>><br>
  <<case 'steps'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The stone steps are clear in the middle, but leaves and grit have packed against their edges. Tsukihan brings a stiff brush and takes the other side.
        <<if Weather.isSnow>>You push snow away from the handrail while <<he>> clears a channel for the meltwater.
        <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>Runoff keeps washing fresh grit down. Tsukihan braces a board across the upper step to divert it.
        <<else>>You scrape moss from the joins and brush it into the tray between you.<</if>><br><br>
        "Wait. That one's loose." <<He>> touches your wrist before you put weight on the edge. You work around the stone, leaving the centre of the step clear.<br><br>
        At the bottom, you look back at the clean strip winding up to the gate. Tsukihan rests the brush against a shoulder.
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70 and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>"Come and look before the leaves cover it again. I want someone to notice." <<He>> nudges the tray towards you with a foot.
        <<else>>"That should make coming up easier." <<He>> picks up the tray. "Especially with your hands full."<</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        石阶中间还算干净，落叶和沙土却积满了两边。月羽拿来硬刷，到另一侧蹲下。
        <<if Weather.isSnow>>你把扶手旁的雪推开，<<he>>在下方清出一道排融雪水的细沟。
        <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>雨水不断冲下新的沙土。月羽横过一块木板，挡住上一级流下来的水。
        <<else>>你刮去石缝里的苔，把碎屑扫进你们中间的浅盘。<</if>><br><br>
        “等一下。那块松了。”你正要踩上石阶边缘，<<he>>碰了碰你的手腕。你们绕开那块石头，把正中的落脚处清了出来。<br><br>
        到了最下面，你们回头看，干净的窄路一路弯到了门架下。月羽把刷子搭在肩边。
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70 and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>“趁还没铺满叶子，下次记得看看。总得有人知道我们扫过。”<<He>>用脚把浅盘往你这边推了推。
        <<else>>“往后上来能好走些。”<<He>>端起浅盘。“尤其手里还提着东西的时候。”<</if>>
    <</language>><<ghousekeeping>><<lstress>><<glove>><br><br>
  <<case 'tie'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Tsukihan takes the weight of the bell while you straighten the cord and check its knot.
        <<if currentSkillValue('handskill') gte 800>>
          You turn the loose ends neatly through the loop and pull the knot tight. <<He>> checks it with a firm tug, then tests it again.<br><br>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"That will hold. Thank you." <<He>> smooths the two ends once more before letting go.
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"Neater than mine." <<He>> compares the ends, then nods.
          <<else>>"That will hold." <<He>> hangs the bell back up, then looks at you. "I kept it steady for you, too. Not a wobble."<</if>>
        <<elseif currentSkillValue('handskill') gte 400>>
          You get the knot together, but one end sits unevenly. Tsukihan points to it with a fingernail. You loosen it, draw the ends through together and try again.<br><br>
          "There. Pull it now. Don't be kind to it; it has to hold a bell."
        <<else>>
          The cord slips loose as you pull. Tsukihan catches it before it can strike the bell.<br><br>
          "Not that way. Here, leave this bit loose." <<He>> holds the loop open while you pass the end through. On your second attempt it stays put.
        <</if>><br><br>
        <<He>> gives the rope one careful pull, then lets it hang free. The clear note fades without the cord catching against the wood.<br><br>
        "That's better." Tsukihan puts the spare cord away and brushes the loose fibres off the board. "I always listen to the first ring in the morning. Sometimes I hear something that needs fixing before I can see it."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        月羽托住铃身，让你理顺挂绳，检查绳结。
        <<if currentSkillValue('handskill') gte 800>>
          你把绳头绕进绳圈，收紧，留出两截齐整的尾端。<<He>>用力拽了一下，又拽一下。<br><br>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“这样就牢靠了。谢谢。”<<He>>又抚齐两截绳头，才松开手。
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“比我系的还整齐。”<<He>>比了比两截绳头，点点头。
          <<else>>“这样就牢了。”<<He>>把铃挂回去，又看看你，“我刚才托得也稳吧？一下都没晃。”<</if>>
        <<elseif currentSkillValue('handskill') gte 400>>
          结是打上了，一边却收得有些偏。月羽用指甲点了点那一处。你松开，把两截绳头一并抽紧，又试了一次。<br><br>
          “对，现在拉。别舍不得使劲，它还得挂着铃呢。”
        <<else>>
          你一拉，绳圈就滑散了。月羽赶在绳头甩上铃身前接住它。<br><br>
          “不是往那边。来，这里先留着。”<<He>>替你撑开绳圈，让你把绳头穿过去。第二次总算没有再散。
        <</if>><br><br>
        <<He>>小心地试拉一下，再松开，让绳子自然垂下。清亮的铃声慢慢散去，挂绳也没有再蹭上木头。<br><br>
        “这就好了。”月羽收起备用绳，把木板上的线屑刷掉。“早上第一遍响，我总会留心听听。有时候，哪儿该修了，倒是先听见，后看见。”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<case 'offerings'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You take the damp plaques one at a time while Tsukihan wipes the table. Some of the cords have tangled together. <<He>> shows you how to ease them apart without scraping the faded writing.<br><br>
        "Writing towards the wall when you put them back, please. People get shy about their wishes." <<He>> nudges a cup away from your elbow. "And this one's mine. It keeps ending up on the offering table."<br><br>
        You space the plaques along a dry board. The writing on the oldest has almost vanished. Tsukihan puts it carefully at the back, where it will be sheltered from the rain.<br><br>
        "I leave them up even when I can't read them anymore. Someone might come back for one." <<He>> tests the cord before hanging it, then steps aside so you can place the next. Together, you finish the table and move the cup safely to the veranda.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你一块块取下受潮的木牌，月羽在旁边擦桌子。几根挂绳缠到一起，<<he>>示意你从结外头慢慢挑开，免得刮掉已经褪色的字。<br><br>
        “挂回去的时候，有字的那面朝里吧。有人不愿意让别人看见自己的心愿。”<<He>>把你肘边的杯子挪开。“这只是我的。也不知道怎么老被搁到供桌上。”<br><br>
        你把木牌间隔着排到一块干木板上。最旧的那块几乎已经看不清字。月羽仔细地把它放到后排淋不到雨的地方。<br><br>
        “字看不清了也先留着。也许有人会回来找。”<<He>>试了试挂绳才挂上去，又让开一点，好让你放下一块。你们收拾好桌面，也把杯子安稳地放回了廊下。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<case 'company'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You settle on the veranda. Tsukihan nods towards a dry cushion, leaving you room to watch.<br><br>
        "That one's fine. The other is still damp in the middle." <<He>> goes back to the rope. For a little while you hear only the cord drawing through <<his>> fingers and the birds shifting overhead.<br><br>
        The knot comes loose on <<his>> first attempt.
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>Tsukihan catches the ends at once. "That wasn't tight enough." <<He>> keeps <<his>> eyes on the cord as <<he>> starts again.
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>><<He>> glances up to see whether you noticed. "Wait a moment. I need to do this end again." The next knot is pulled rather more firmly.
        <<else>>"That doesn't count. I hadn't said it was ready." Tsukihan gathers the loose ends, pulls the next knot tight and tests it again before letting go. Only then does <<he>> glance back at you.<</if>><br><br>
        Once it holds, <<he>> sits down to sort the wooden plaques.
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70 and isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>"Spend this part of the day with me," <<he>> says, putting the tray within reach. "You needn't find another job. Sitting there is quite enough."
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70 and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>"Don't run off just yet, if you're free." <<He>> puts the tray between you. "I don't want to spend the rest of this talking to the birds."
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>"Thank you for waiting. I'll finish these before I put the tools away." <<He>> sits with the tray across <<his>> knees.
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>"Could you sit a little longer?" <<He>> moves the tray closer. "I'd like some company while I finish."
        <<else>>"These won't take much longer." <<He>> leaves the cushion beside yours in place. "There's no need to hurry off."<</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你在廊下坐定。月羽指了指一只干燥的坐垫，给你留出看得见的地方。<br><br>
        “坐这个吧。旁边那只中间还没干。”<<He>>继续摆弄绳子。过了一会儿，你只听见绳子从指间抽过的声音，还有头顶鸟儿挪动的轻响。<br><br>
        第一遍没系牢。
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>月羽立刻接住绳头。“刚才没收紧。”<<He>>低头重新系起来，视线没有再离开绳子。
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>><<He>>抬眼看看你有没有注意到。“等我一下，这头还得重来。”下一个结明显拉得更用力了。
        <<else>>“这遍不算，还没说系好了。”月羽拢起绳头，把下一个结收紧，试拉过才松手。这才抬眼看看你。<</if>><br><br>
        系稳以后，<<he>>坐下来整理木牌。
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70 and isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>“今天这段时间陪我。”<<He>>把浅盘放到随手够得着的地方，“不用再找活了。坐在那里就好。”
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70 and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>“有空的话，先别急着走。”<<He>>把浅盘放在你们中间，“剩下这点东西，不想又只跟鸟说话。”
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>“谢谢你等着。我把这些归置好，再收工具。”<<He>>坐下来，把浅盘搁在膝上。
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>“能不能再坐一会儿？”<<He>>把浅盘挪近些，“想有人陪着收完这点东西。”
        <<else>>“剩下的很快就收好了。”<<He>>没有拿走你身旁的坐垫，“不急着回去的话，可以再坐坐。”<</if>>
    <</language>><br><br>
<</switch>><br>
<<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>>

:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Tea
<<effects>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-presence>>
<<if !_shrinePerson or _shrine.scene isnot 'tea'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The tea things have been put away. The veranda is empty now.' '茶具已经收起，廊下现在空着。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>>
<<switch _shrine.step>>
  <<case ''>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Tsukihan pours the tea, then sets a tin beside the pot. <<He>> opens it just far enough to take out two biscuits before snapping the lid shut. A raven on the railing tilts its head.<br><br>
        "You had yours," Tsukihan tells the raven, then slides your biscuit towards you.
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70 and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>><<He>> checks the two pieces and keeps the one with the crisp brown edge. "This one's mine. I was hoping there'd be one left."<</if>>
        There are little squares of scrap paper beneath the tin. Tsukihan takes one and starts folding it while the tea cools.<br><br>
        A crease goes the wrong way. <<He>> flattens the paper with <<his>> thumb, frowning. The paper bird has a very short tail.
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"That fold should go the other way." <<He>> opens it again, <<his>> red eyes following the crease. "One moment, please."
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"The tail needs a little work. Would you look at it from that side?" <<He>> turns it towards you.
        <<else>>"Look at the wings first. Those came out well." <<He>> turns the short tail away from you. "I haven't finished the rest."<</if>>
        <<if _shrine.memory is 'paper_raven'>><br><br>"Did the last one survive the trip home?" <<he>> asks. "I should make them something to travel in."<</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        月羽倒好茶，把一只铁盒搁在壶边。<<He>>只掀开一道够取出两块饼干的缝，便啪地扣上盒盖。栏杆上的渡鸦歪过头。<br><br>
        “你那份已经吃过了。”月羽对渡鸦说完，才把你的饼干推过来。
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70 and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>><<He>>比了比两块饼干，把烤得焦黄的那块留给自己。“这块我的。还以为没有了呢。”<</if>>
        铁盒底下垫着几张裁方的废纸。等茶凉些的工夫，月羽抽出一张折起来。<br><br>
        有道折痕压反了。<<He>>皱皱眉，用拇指把纸抚平。纸鸟的尾巴短了一截。
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“这里应该往另一面折。”<<He>>重新展开纸，一双红眼睛盯着那道折痕，“请稍等。”
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“尾巴还得改改。你从那边看看，行么？”<<He>>把纸鸟转向你。
        <<else>>“先看翅膀，这里折得挺好。”<<He>>把短尾巴转开，“别的还没弄完。”<</if>>
        <<if _shrine.memory is 'paper_raven'>><br><br>“上回那只平安带回去了么？”<<he>>问，“看来还得给它们做个出门用的盒子。”<</if>>
    <</language>><br><br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations')?.Undead.active>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You cannot taste the biscuit. Tsukihan notices you turn it over in your fingers. "Not to your liking?" You try to explain. <<He>> leaves the tin closed, but moves the paper closer. "We can do this instead."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          饼干在嘴里没有半点味道。月羽见你捏着剩下的半块翻看，问道：“不喜欢么？”你试着解释。<<He>>没有再开铁盒，只把折纸往你这边推了推。“那就一起做这个吧。”
      <</language>>
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
    <<icon 'raven-shrine/paper-raven.png'>><<lanLink ['Ask Tsukihan to show you how', '请月羽教你折一只'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Tea'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'learn' 'tea'>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ['Tease Tsukihan about the little raven', '拿那只纸鸦逗逗月羽'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Tea'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'joke' 'tea'>>
    <</lanLink>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint>><br>
    <<icon 'orchard/tea-tray.png'>><<lanLink ['Drink your tea and watch', '喝着茶，看月羽折'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Tea'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'watch' 'tea'>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 'learn'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Here. Line these corners up first." Tsukihan gives you a fresh square and opens <<his>> own bird back up to the first fold.
        <<if pcAreArmsBound('any')>><<He>> keeps your paper steady on the tray while you make the creases with your free hand.<</if>><br><br>
        You work through it together. <<He>> has to turn yours around once to find which end will be the head.
        <<if currentSkillValue('handskill') gte 800>>By the time you fold out the wings, yours sits more neatly than the example. Tsukihan puts them side by side.
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"The wings are even. You've got it." <<He>> adjusts <<his>> own bird while studying yours.
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"Could I look at yours?" <<He>> balances <<his>> beside it. "I want to try that fold again."
          <<else>>"I was supposed to be teaching you." <<He>> compares the two birds and presses <<his>> own wing flat again. "I haven't finished adjusting this one."<</if>>
        <<else>>One wing sticks up higher than the other. Tsukihan adjusts the feet until the bird balances. "A little wind under that wing. That's all."<</if>><br><br>
        You set your paper raven aside to finish your tea. Tsukihan places <<his>> own short-tailed bird beside your cup. "You can take mine, if you'd like. Or leave it to guard the biscuits."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “来，先把这两个角对齐。”月羽递给你一张新纸，又把自己的鸟拆回了第一道折痕。
        <<if pcAreArmsBound('any')>><<He>>替你把纸按在浅盘上，让你用能活动的那只手压出折痕。<</if>><br><br>
        你们一步步折下来。<<He>>有一回得把你的纸转过来，才找着哪边该是鸟头。
        <<if currentSkillValue('handskill') gte 800>>等翅膀展开，你那只倒比示范的站得整齐。月羽把两只并在一起。
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“翅膀对齐了。这样就对。”<<He>>对照着你的，调整自己那只。
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“借我看看你的，行么？”<<He>>把自己的也往旁边立，“这里还想重折一下。”
          <<else>>“明明是我在教你。”<<He>>比了比两只鸟，又把自己那只的翅膀压平。“这只还没调好呢。”<</if>>
        <<else>>有边翅膀高出一截。月羽摆了摆纸鸟的脚，让它站稳。“这边赶上风了。就这么回事。”<</if>><br><br>
        你暂且把自己折的纸鸦放下，准备喝完剩下的茶。月羽把自己那只短尾巴的放到你杯边。“我这只，喜欢就带着吧。留在这儿看饼干也行。”
    <</language>><br><br>
    <<icon 'raven-shrine/paper-raven.png'>><<lanLink ['Keep the paper raven', '收下纸鸦'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Tea'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'keep' 'tea' 'paper_raven' 'learn'>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ['Leave it beside the biscuit tin', '把它留在饼干盒旁'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Tea'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'return_paper' 'tea' '' 'learn'>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 'joke'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>You raise an eyebrow and point out the paper raven's lopsided shape.
        <<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>You hold back a smile, glancing between the paper raven and the bird watching the biscuits.
        <<else>>You point out that it seems to be looking backwards.<</if>><br><br>
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"The tail is folded under. I know." Tsukihan turns the bird over, revealing the mistake, and carefully pulls it free. <<He>> sets it upright before looking at you again.
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"It's watching for biscuit thieves." Tsukihan turns the bird to face you. "Very important work." A smile escapes before <<he>> can turn it away.
        <<else>>"It just isn't standing properly." Tsukihan holds the bird up, then turns it a fraction. "You make one next time. The neater one stays with me." <<He>> straightens the wings before looking up to see your reaction.<</if>><br><br>
        <<He>> pinches the tail back out and puts the bird beside your cup. "There. You can supervise each other. Want it?"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>你挑起眉，指了指纸鸦歪斜的模样。
        <<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>你忍着笑，在纸鸦和那只盯着饼干的渡鸦之间来回看。
        <<else>>你指指纸鸟，告诉月羽，它看起来像在往身后张望。<</if>><br><br>
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“尾巴折在下面了。我知道。”月羽翻过纸鸟，露出压错的那一截，仔细挑开。把它放稳以后，<<he>>才重新看向你。
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“它在防着偷饼干的。”月羽把纸鸟转向你，“这可是要紧事。”还没来得及转开，<<he>>自己先露出一点笑意。
        <<else>>“就是没站好而已。”月羽举起纸鸟，转了一点，又转回去。“下回你也折一只。哪只更齐整，就把哪只留给我。”<<He>>理好翅膀，才抬眼看你的反应。<</if>><br><br>
        <<He>>把短了一截的尾巴挑出来，搁到你的杯边。“好了。你们两个互相看着吧。要不要？”
    <</language>><br><br>
    <<icon 'raven-shrine/paper-raven.png'>><<lanLink ['Keep the paper raven', '收下纸鸦'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Tea'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'keep' 'tea' 'paper_raven' 'joke'>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ['Leave it beside the biscuit tin', '把它留在饼干盒旁'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Tea'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'return_paper' 'tea' '' 'joke'>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 'watch'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You settle back with your tea. Tsukihan keeps folding, turning the little bird in <<his>> hands.<br><br>
        "I used to make these from receipts. It didn't make sorting the accounts any easier." <<He>> presses the tail flat. "I should have used something without numbers on it."<br><br>
        The raven on the railing peers down at the result. "It's not for you," <<he>> tells it. Tsukihan moves the bird away from the beak and closer to you. "Would you like it?"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你端着茶坐稳，看月羽把小鸟在手里转了个面，又压下一道折痕。<br><br>
        “以前拿收据折过。后来对账可费了好一番功夫。”<<He>>把尾巴压平。“就该挑没写数的纸。”<br><br>
        栏杆上的渡鸦也探过脑袋来看。“没说给你。”<<He>>把小鸟从鸟喙底下挪开，朝你这边放近了些。“你想要么？”
    <</language>><br><br>
    <<icon 'raven-shrine/paper-raven.png'>><<lanLink ['Keep the paper raven', '收下纸鸦'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Tea'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'keep' 'tea' 'paper_raven' 'watch'>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ['Leave it beside the biscuit tin', '把它留在饼干盒旁'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Tea'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'return_paper' 'tea' '' 'watch'>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 'keep'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You accept the little paper raven. Tsukihan bends one wing down so it will be easier to carry.<br><br>
        "There. Just open it again when you get back."
        <<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>><<He>> straightens its wing, though it is already flat. "If you bring it back next time, I can see whether it travelled well."
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>><<He>> smiles across the cups. "Bring it back next time. I'd like to see how it gets on."
          <<else>>"You can take it this time. Next time, make one for me." <<He>> watches you tuck it away. "And bring yourself. The bird doesn't count as a visit."<</if>>
        <<else>>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>"Take it, then. Next time, I want to see how you fold one." <<He>> gives its short tail one last adjustment.
          <<else>><<He>> checks the folds once more before nodding. "Keep it somewhere it won't be crushed."<</if>>
        <</if>><br><br>
        The raven on the railing tries to get at the biscuit tin again. Tsukihan taps the lid. "You've been outvoted." You finish your tea while <<he>> keeps the tin within reach.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你收下小纸鸦。月羽把一边翅膀折低一点，让你方便拿着。<br><br>
        “这样。回去了再展开就好。”
        <<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>><<He>>又理了理已经压平的翅膀。“下次带来的话，就知道路上有没有压坏了。”
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>><<He>>隔着茶杯笑了笑。“下回带来吧。我想看看它过得怎么样。”
          <<else>>“这次先给你。下回也给我折一只。”<<He>>看着你收好，“人也要来。只让鸟送来可不算。”<</if>>
        <<else>>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>“拿去吧。下回我也要看看你折的。”<<He>>又理了理那截短尾巴。
          <<else>><<He>>再看了一遍折痕，才点头。“放在不容易压坏的地方。”<</if>>
        <</if>><br><br>
        栏杆上的渡鸦又想够饼干盒。月羽敲敲盒盖。“少数服从多数。”你喝完了茶，<<he>>一直把铁盒留在随手够得着的地方。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<case 'return_paper'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You leave the paper raven beside the tin. Tsukihan turns it so that its beak points at the real one.<br><br>
        "Good. It can do the watching while I put the cups away." <<He>> nudges the tin an inch farther from the railing, then sits with you until the last of the tea is gone.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你把纸鸦留在铁盒旁。月羽转了个方向，让它的喙正对着真渡鸦。<br><br>
        “挺好。待会儿我收杯子，让它看着。”<<He>>把铁盒往离栏杆更远的地方挪了一点，又陪你坐着，把杯里最后一点茶喝完。
    <</language>><br><br>
<</switch>><br>
<<deadwood-raven-shrine-return 'veranda'>>

:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Walk
<<effects>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-presence>>
<<if !_shrinePerson or _shrine.scene isnot 'walk'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot set out with Tsukihan now.' '现在没法和月羽一起出去了。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>>
<<switch _shrine.step>>
  <<case ''>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Tsukihan takes you along the side of the shrine, past a shutter that <<he>> stops to fasten properly.<br><br>
        "This hook works loose when the wind changes. I can hear it from inside." <<He>> presses it into place and moves on.
        <<if Weather.isSnow>>Snow has gathered along the edge of the path. <<He>> tests a patch of bare stone with <<his>> foot before stepping on it.
        <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>The rain has softened to a fine spray. Water shines on the stones between the trees, and <<he>> picks the drier edges of the path.
        <<else>>The trees shelter this side of the building. A few dry leaves turn across the path, catching against the stone edging.<</if>><br><br>
        <<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>
          At the narrow bend, Tsukihan turns and offers you <<his>> hand, palm up.
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"The stones are uneven here." <<He>> watches the path beside your feet while <<his>> hand stays between you.
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"Shall we hold hands for this bit?" <<His>> fingers curl a little before opening again.
          <<else>>"Keep me company for this part." <<He>> holds <<his>> hand out to you. "May I hold your hand?"<</if>>
        <<else>>
          <<He>> stops at the narrow bend and looks back to make sure you are keeping up.
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"Please watch your step. The pond is just ahead."
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"Still coming? There's something by the pond I wanted to show you."
          <<else>>"Come and see the stone bird. Nobody ever notices it from the gate."<</if>>
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        月羽领你绕到神社侧面，经过一扇百叶窗时，还停下来把窗钩扣牢。<br><br>
        “一变风向，这个钩子就松。在屋里都听得见。”<<He>>把它压稳，继续往前走。
        <<if Weather.isSnow>>路沿积着雪。<<He>>先用脚试了试露出的石面，才踩上去。
        <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>雨小得像一层细雾。树间的石头泛着水光，<<he>>挑着干些的边沿走。
        <<else>>屋子这侧有树挡着风。几片干叶在小路上打着转，卡在石头砌成的路沿。<</if>><br><br>
        <<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>
          走到狭窄的转角，月羽转过身，掌心朝上向你伸出手。
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“这里的石头不太平。”<<He>>看着你脚边的路，伸出的手一直留在你们中间。
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“这一段牵着走，好么？”<<His>>手指轻轻蜷了一下，又松开。
          <<else>>“这段路陪着我。”<<He>>把手伸给你，“这只手也借我，好不好？”<</if>>
        <<else>>
          <<He>>在狭窄的转角停了停，回头看看你有没有跟上。
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“请小心脚下。池塘就在前面。”
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“跟得上么？池塘边有样东西，想给你看看。”
          <<else>>“来看看那只石鸦。站在门口，总没人注意到它。”<</if>>
        <</if>>
    <</language>><br><br>
    <<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>
      <<loveicon>><<lanLink ['Take Tsukihan’s hand', '握住月羽的手'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Walk'>>
        <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'hand' 'walk'>>
      <</lanLink>><<handholdingvirginitywarning>><<glust>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<icon 'actions/walk.png'>><<lanLink ['Walk alongside Tsukihan', '和月羽并肩走'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Walk'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'along' 'walk'>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink [Weather.isSnow or Weather.precipitation is 'rain' ? 'Head back under the eaves' : 'Go back and sit on the veranda', Weather.isSnow or Weather.precipitation is 'rain' ? '先回廊下避一避' : '回廊下坐会儿'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Walk'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'shelter' 'walk'>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 'hand'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You put your hand in Tsukihan's. <<He>> closes <<his>> fingers around it, then adjusts <<his>> pace to yours. <<His>> sleeve brushes your wrist as you round the corner.<br><br>
        At the pond, a leaf drifts across the water and catches at the foot of a stone lantern. Tsukihan is about to say something, then stops to look at you.<br><br>
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"I was going to tell you which stones wobble." <<He>> looks back at the path, though <<his>> hand stays around yours. "You've found them all by now."
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"We can go a little slower." You feel <<his>> thumb move over your knuckles. <<He>> smiles and turns back to the water.
        <<elseif isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>"I wanted a little time with you to myself." <<He>> keeps your hand in <<his>>. "We'll check the other shutters on the way back. For now, stay here with me."
        <<else>>"There are more loose stones on the way back. We should take our time." <<He>> turns to check the path.<</if>><br><br>
        You linger by the water, your hands still joined, until <<he>> notices the light catching the loose shutter. "I'd better check the other hooks before I forget." <<He>> gives your hand a gentle squeeze before you start back together.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你把手放进月羽的掌心。<<He>>收拢手指，又放慢一些，好和你迈着一样的步子。绕过转角时，<<his>>袖口轻轻扫过你的手腕。<br><br>
        一片叶子漂过池面，停在石灯笼的底座旁。月羽本来要说什么，转过头看着你，又停了一下。<br><br>
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“刚才想告诉你，哪几块石头踩着会晃。”<<He>>回头看看小路，手却仍然握着你的。“现在应该都知道了吧。”
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“走慢一点也好。”你感觉到<<his>>拇指在指节上轻轻动了动。<<He>>笑笑，又看向水面。
        <<elseif isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>“就想这一小会儿，你只陪着我。”<<He>>仍牵着你的手，“回去再看另外几扇窗。现在先在这里待会儿。”
        <<else>>“回去也有几块松动的石头。慢些走吧。”<<He>>转身看了看小路。<</if>><br><br>
        你们牵着手在水边待了一会儿。月羽瞥见百叶窗上晃动的光，才记起事情来。“还得看看另外几个窗钩。再坐下去又要忘了。”回去之前，<<he>>轻轻捏了一下你的手。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<case 'along'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You come up beside Tsukihan. <<He>> leaves you room on the path, and you round the bend together without hurrying.<br><br>
        There is a stone raven half-hidden behind the pond. Its beak is much less weathered than the ones by the gate. You stop to look.<br><br>
        "I found it face down under that bush," Tsukihan says. "Thought it was only a lump of stone until I tried to move it." <<He>> traces a scrape on the base with one finger. "Nearly left it there after that."<br><br>
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70 and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>"Next time, let me choose the path again." <<He>> looks back towards the pond. "There's another stone bird I want you to see."
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>"Would you come this way with me next time, too?" <<he>> asks as you turn back. "There's always something I forget to show you."
        <<else>><<He>> looks back at it once before you leave. "Better view from up there, anyway."<</if>> You return past the shutters, checking their hooks as you go.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你走到月羽身边。<<He>>给你留出路面，你们不紧不慢地一起绕过转角。<br><br>
        池塘后面半藏着一只石鸦，喙尖比门口那两只完整得多。你停下来看看。<br><br>
        “从那丛灌木底下翻出来的。”月羽说，“本来以为就是块石头，想搬开才看见脸。”<<He>>用手指沿着底座的一道划痕摸过去。“差点又给它放回去了。”<br><br>
        <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70 and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>“下回还让我挑路吧。”<<He>>又往池塘那边看看，“还有一只石鸦，想带你去看。”
        <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>转身回去时，<<he>>又问：“下回也陪我走这边，好么？总有东西忘了带你看。”
        <<else>><<He>>走前又回头瞅了一眼。“总归还是站高些，看得远点。”<</if>>你们经过那排百叶窗，一路检查着挂钩回了廊下。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<case 'shelter'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You turn towards the veranda. Tsukihan nods and comes with you.
        <<if Weather.isSnow or Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"The boards under the eaves are dry." <<He>> folds <<his>> chilled hands into <<his>> sleeves once you reach them.
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"We should have turned back sooner." <<He>> rubs <<his>> hands together. "It's colder than I thought."
          <<else>>"Yes, please. My hands are freezing." <<He>> rubs them together as soon as you reach the eaves. "I wanted to show you the pond, but it'll still be there tomorrow."<</if>>
        <<else>>"It is more comfortable here," <<he>> agrees, lowering <<himself>> onto the dry boards.<</if>><br><br>
        <<He>> moves a shallow tray off the space beside <<him>>, then checks <<his>> sleeves before settling back against a post.<br><br>
        "It's a small place, but I can spend the whole day walking around it. There's always something." <<He>> starts to stand again, catches <<himself>> and sits back with a sigh. "The other windows can wait a minute."<br><br>
        You sit together for a while, listening to the leaves and the birds. There is no need to make a conversation out of it. When Tsukihan stands to check the shutter hooks, <<he>> leaves you the dry seat.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你转向回廊。月羽点点头，跟着你回去。
        <<if Weather.isSnow or Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“檐下的地板干一些。”走到廊下，<<he>>才把冻凉的手拢进袖中。
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“该早点回来的。”<<He>>搓搓手，“比想的还冷些。”
          <<else>>“快回去吧，手都冻僵了。”一到檐下，<<he>>便搓起手，“本来还想带你看池塘。不过，明天也还在。”<</if>>
        <<else>>“还是这儿坐着舒服。”<<He>>说着，在干燥的木地板上坐了下来。<</if>><br><br>
        <<He>>把身旁占地方的浅盘挪开，又检查了下袖口，才靠着柱子坐稳。<br><br>
        “地方就这么点大，一天也能来来回回走个不停。总有点事。”<<He>>刚要起身，又反应过来，叹口气坐了回去。“另外几个窗户，等会儿再看。”<br><br>
        你们一块儿坐了会儿，听听树叶的响动和鸟叫，没特地找话说。月羽起身去检查窗钩时，把那块干燥的座位留给了你。
    <</language>><br><br>
<</switch>><br>
<<deadwood-raven-shrine-return 'pond'>>
